---
const avatars = Array.from({ length: 16 }, (_, index) => {
	const number = index + 1;
	return { number, key: `avatar${number}`, src: `/avatars/avatar${number}.${number <= 8 ? 'png' : 'jpg'}` };
});
---

<section class="comment-section glass-card" id="comments" data-glass-tier="page" aria-labelledby="comment-section-title">
	<div class="comment-heading">
		<h2 id="comment-section-title">评论</h2>
		<p>填写昵称，选一个头像，就可以留言。</p>
	</div>
	<details class="comment-notice">
		<summary>留言须知</summary>
		<p>留言发出后不可自助修改或删除，如需删除请联系博主。文中未公开的细节涉及隐私，如有疑问，请私下联系博主。</p>
	</details>
	<template id="comment-avatar-template">
		<div class="comment-avatar-picker">
			<div class="comment-avatar-heading">
				<span>头像</span>
				<div class="comment-avatar-actions">
					<button type="button" data-avatar-random>随机</button>
					<button type="button" data-avatar-upload aria-pressed="false">上传</button>
					<input type="file" data-avatar-file accept="image/*" hidden />
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="comment-avatar-options" role="group" aria-label="选择评论头像">
				{avatars.map(({ number, key, src }) => (
					<button type="button" data-avatar={key} aria-label={`头像 ${number}`} aria-pressed="false">
						<img src={src} width="36" height="36" alt="" />
					</button>
				))}
			</div>
			<p class="comment-avatar-status" role="status" hidden></p>
		</div>
	</template>
	<div id="waline"></div>
</section>

<style>
	.comment-section { margin-top: var(--layout-gap); padding: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); scroll-margin-top: 5.5rem; }
	.comment-heading { display: grid; gap: 0.28rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
	.comment-heading h2 { margin: 0; font: 600 clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.2rem)/1.15 var(--font-display); }
	.comment-heading p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
	.comment-notice { margin-bottom: 1.15rem; font-size: 0.83rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
	.comment-notice summary { width: fit-content; cursor: pointer; color: var(--rose-ink); }
	.comment-notice p { margin: 0.45rem 0 0; line-height: 1.65; }
</style>

<script>
	import '@waline/client/style';
	import { mountComments } from '../scripts/comments';

	const root = document.getElementById('waline');
	const template = document.querySelector<HTMLTemplateElement>('#comment-avatar-template');
	if (root && template) {
		const load = () => mountComments(root, template).catch(() => {
			root.textContent = '评论区加载失败，请刷新页面后重试。';
		});
		if ('IntersectionObserver' in window) {
			const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
				if (!entries.some((entry) => entry.isIntersecting)) return;
				observer.disconnect();
				void load();
			}, { rootMargin: '500px 0px' });
			observer.observe(root);
		} else {
			void load();
		}
	}
</script>
